+# Release notes: 2.3.0
+
+## Breaking
+
+- The `--legacy-auth` flag is gone. Use `--auth token` instead.
+
+## What's new
+
+- Export invoices as CSV.
+- Search is faster on accounts with more than 10,000 invoices.
+
+## Fixes
+
+- Customer names with an emoji no longer cause a crash.
